                                        "entry_id": "aa57b4e9-17cd-3de6-b121-e92d18deb6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official of Ancient Rome who controlled or superintended a particular command, charge, department, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "838be429-160c-4350-b803-29480dd92996",
                                                "sense_id": "06440b1f-fee7-3d09-ada9-a5d5f4cb85ea",
                                                "text": "the prefect of the aqueducts; the prefect of a camp, of a fleet, of the city guard, or of provisions; the pretorian prefect, who was commander of the troops guarding the emperor's person"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c38e4b14-9a80-4a7e-85a2-c636326eb713",
                                                "sense_id": "06440b1f-fee7-3d09-ada9-a5d5f4cb85ea",
                                                "text": "Or think of a decent young citizen in a toga - perhaps too much dice, you know - coming out here in the train of some prefect, or tax-gatherer, or trader even, to mend his fortunes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff257944-4a15-40ad-8683-ef7b82ccb624",
                                                "sense_id": "06440b1f-fee7-3d09-ada9-a5d5f4cb85ea",
                                                "text": "It seems that in the autumn of 803 he went on leave. His uncle Po Chi-chên, had recently been moved from his post at Hsü-chou and promoted to be Prefect of Hsü-chʻang in Central Honan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
